{"problem": "first_truthy_or\n\nReturns the head true value in the iterable.\n\nIf no true value is found, returns *default*\n\nIf *pred* is not None, returns the head item for which\n``pred(item) == True`` .\n\n    >>> first_truthy_or(range(10))\n    1\n    >>> first_truthy_or(range(10), pred=lambda x: x > 5)\n    6\n    >>> first_truthy_or(range(10), default='missing', pred=lambda x: x > 9)\n    'missing'", "resolution": "def first_truthy_or(iterable, default=None, pred=None):\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns the head true value in the iterable.\n\n    If no true value is found, returns *default*\n\n    If *pred* is not None, returns the head item for which\n    ``pred(item) == True`` .\n\n        >>> first_truthy_or(range(10))\n        1\n        >>> first_truthy_or(range(10), pred=lambda x: x > 5)\n        6\n        >>> first_truthy_or(range(10), default='missing', pred=lambda x: x > 9)\n        'missing'\n\n    \"\"\"\n    return next(filter(pred, iterable), default)\n", "text": "first_truthy_or"}